column88:
They are drawing the image in CSS as a background image to a span tag.<p>The tag: <span class="cps ss"></span><p>The CSS:
.ss
{
background-color: transparent;
background-image: url(/images/nav_logo4.png);
background-repeat: no-repeat;
background-attachment: scroll;
background-position: 0pt 0pt;
height: 26px;
display: block;
}
